e_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.poster.avif?t=1762169413\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.webm?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.mp4?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>",
